      "offset": 53154,
      "old": "\"reason\":\"The first original runtime group completed19 indices with18 failure flags and one pass. Its nonempty45026-byte stderr independently invalidated the strict owner binding even though the retained native process exited0. The remaining42 accepted indices in three groups were not started. The reviewed fixture-only source correction still requires fresh validation.\"",
