    {
      "specification": 65,
      "occurrence": 1,
      "label": "Three outcomes separated in successor plan",
      "offset": 57263,
      "old": " \"V36 new4 completed BuildQuery with61 accepted metadata records, then strict runtime completed19 indices with18 failed and one passed; \"\n \"42 indices in three groups were unstarted. The separate regression63 batch was not started. These are exact historical observations \"\n \"and do not qualify the corrected fixture. Keep the strict driver, classifier, 64-group cap, and all source/ownership/deadline gates.\"",
      "new": " \"V37 initial admission failed before proof creation or native phases. Its separate fresh Retry1 completed BuildQuery with 61 accepted metadata records, \"\n \"then strict runtime completed 19 indices with five failed and fourteen passed; 42 indices in three groups were unstarted. \"\n \"The separate regression63 batch was never issued or started. These exact historical observations do not qualify either corrected source file. \"\n \"V38 must consume selected_current_source_roots; new_source_roots retains its complete original historical pins. \"\n \"Keep the strict driver, classifier, 64-group cap, and all source/ownership/deadline gates.\"",
      "before_sha256": "7D41C5796324F84E5D52917AE00F9A04E826641D6CDEB4147072133814ECB5A7",
